Also on Linux it's gonna be a non-problem as it just needs support from Mesa 3D and Vulkan to work with everything, no need to mess with old DirectX stuff, hence why I mentioned DXVK might be good on Windows for these cards, enthusiasts will just have to test it and figure it out.

